{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Breaks in 4.5\n- Works in 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn godot 4.4 and before, turning the unicode character **0** into a string using ``String.chr`` or ``char`` would produce an empty string. In godot 4.5, doing the same now produces a string with the character that is defined by unicode 0.\n\nThis behavior may make more sense, but the engine does not seems to handle strings with this character very well, if you try to print a string containing this character the printed text following the character will disappear. This leads to entire chunks of print statements disappearing which is a huge headache.\n\nHere is an example(from the reproduction project) where I print the string ``Hi`` + *unicode character 0*\n\nIn `4.4`;\n```\nUsing string.chr: 'Hi!' Length: 3\nUsing char: 'Hi!' Length: 3\n```\n\nIn `4.5`:\n```\nUsing string.chr: 'Hi!\n```\n(The output unexpectedly stops when it encounters the 0 character)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun this script, both in 4.4 and 4.5, or run my project.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar text1 : String = \"Hi!\" + String.chr(0)\n\tprint(\"Using string.chr: '\", text1, \"' Length: \", len(text1))\n\tvar text2 : String = \"Hi!\" + char(0)\n\tprint(\"Using char: '\", text2, \"' Length: \", len(text1))\n```\n\n\n\nIf you want to see the print statement issue, only run this:\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint(char(0))\n\tfor i in range(100):\n\t\tprint(i)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[is-godot-tweaking.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22354888/is-godot-tweaking.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110545/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}